DESCRIPTION:45-min flat Z1 spin capped at 128W maximum — only execute if 
 morning body battery is ≥55 AND sleep averaged ≥6 hours for August 4
 –7\; otherwise replace with a 30-min easy walk. Drop the 84km distance t
 arget entirely this week.\n\nReason: Recovery from the severe sleep defici
 t of late July will not be complete by August 8\, so a hard cap on both du
 ration and power protects against compounding fatigue entering the critica
 l Half Oceanman build weeks.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-01
