DESCRIPTION:70–90 min at 128–160W (low Z2)\, flat route\, no distance t
 arget — add Z3 tempo blocks only if morning body battery is ≥60 AND sl
 eep averaged ≥6.5 hours for August 11–14\; cap at 100 min absolute max
 imum.\n\nReason: Jumping to a 240-min ride in week 8 after the severe depl
 etion of late July is too aggressive\; a gated\, shorter ride maintains fi
 tness stimulus while protecting the athlete from overreach heading into th
 e Half Oceanman peak block.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-01
