DESCRIPTION:60 min pool session: 2\,500m total — 400m warm-up\, 3×600m @
  2:25–2:30/100m with 45-sec rest (extend rest to 60 sec if pace slips be
 yond 2:35/100m)\, 300m cool-down\; this is the first true Half Oceanman ra
 ce-pace rehearsal\, so prioritise pacing control over speed.\n\nReason: Wi
 th the Half Oceanman 5\,000m swim as the nearest race priority\, this sess
 ion must anchor race-pace rehearsal at 2:30/100m — structured with appro
 priate rest intervals given the athlete is returning from a predominantly 
 open-water-only swim block.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-01
END:VEVENT
